{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26243914921863669", "organization": {"id": "1080500500041434", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26243914921863669"}]}, "id": "2005374233544743"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "26243914921863669", "release_date": 1781182440, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28199036756351466"}, "id": "710658664993358"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1785155656, "id": "28791766110411858", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v3", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 2, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "28734923552762781"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "26243914921863669"}, "id": "28734923552762781", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": null, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_1532040511976977_5768463065224756011_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3zZ6oYWk4JkQ7kNvwFidQrT&_nc_oc=AdoU0Dz_yDO4GMDcxagGC3D4aPtnAd5x7CiyOmYI1dAHo28CZotM-nLVFiWBxQSPAJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEB_LoUAx7CaiuwdLsBf1WM-lv7v-zcHXrghrzTUszk1g&oe=6A941A61"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Shooter", "id": "3744040075834813"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Survival", "id": "644354873106712"}], "release_date": 1781182440, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26243914955196999", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26243914921863669", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1347352787243875"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1798008054558676", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Was als Rettungsmission beginnt, enth\u00fcllt schon bald etwas weitaus Schlimmeres: eine t\u00f6dliche parasit\u00e4re Infektion, die mit den geheimen Experimenten von Dr. Summers in Verbindung steht.\n\nErkunde verlassene H\u00e4user, unterirdische Labore, verseuchte Stra\u00dfen und verborgene Anlagen, w\u00e4hrend du versuchst, in einer Welt voller Chaos zu \u00fcberleben.\n\n**\u2022 Intensiver Kampf gegen infizierte Kreaturen und monstr\u00f6se Mutationen**\n\n**\u2022 Vielf\u00e4ltige Waffen, darunter Pistolen, Gewehre, \u00c4xte und H\u00e4mmer**\n{855205060517682}\n\n**\u2022 Furchteinfl\u00f6\u00dfende atmosph\u00e4rische Umgebungen**\n\nJeder Ort birgt neue Gefahren. Jede Begegnung k\u00f6nnte deine letzte sein.\n\nWirst du \u00fcberleben?\n{1550547443364928}", "short_description": "\u00dcberlebe einen t\u00f6dlichen Parasitenausbruch in immersiver Virtual Reality. K\u00e4mpfe um dein Leben, entdecke die Wahrheit hinter Dr. Summers' Experimenten und entkomme, bevor es zu sp\u00e4t ist."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1622088305529922", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": ["Sobreviv\u00eancia", "Terror", "Zumbi", "Infectados", "Apocalipse"], "long_description": "O que come\u00e7a como uma opera\u00e7\u00e3o de resgate logo revela algo muito pior: uma infec\u00e7\u00e3o parasit\u00e1ria mortal ligada aos experimentos secretos do Dr. Summers.\n\nExplore casas abandonadas, laborat\u00f3rios subterr\u00e2neos, ruas infestadas e instala\u00e7\u00f5es ocultas enquanto luta para sobreviver em um mundo mergulhando no caos.\n\n**\u2022 Combate intenso contra criaturas infectadas e muta\u00e7\u00f5es monstruosas**\n\n**\u2022 Diversas armas, incluindo pistolas, rifles, machados e martelos**\n{1680716803027028}\n\n**\u2022 Ambientes aterrorizantes e atmosf\u00e9ricos**\n\nCada local esconde novas amea\u00e7as. Cada encontro pode ser o seu \u00faltimo.\n\nVoc\u00ea sobreviver\u00e1?\n{4458269361125515}", "short_description": "Sobreviva a um surto mortal de parasitas em realidade virtual imersiva. Lute pela sua vida, descubra a verdade por tr\u00e1s dos experimentos do Dr. Summers e escape antes que seja tarde demais."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "City_of_Hunger_youtube4.png", "id": "1532040505310311", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_1532040511976977_5768463065224756011_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3zZ6oYWk4JkQ7kNvwFidQrT&_nc_oc=AdoU0Dz_yDO4GMDcxagGC3D4aPtnAd5x7CiyOmYI1dAHo28CZotM-nLVFiWBxQSPAJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGuMC5mD40HRYHiTNdhfLZQKKMouTeLE1QBFZajRffCPg&oe=6A941A61"}, {"file_name": "Master1x1_new.png", "id": "1462982002267945", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1462982008934611_1064764494866257167_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OWWY3fV9C6gQ7kNvwHH7vsU&_nc_oc=Adq74uXU3bOjZasMizN1zZKDxsUZBoR7Yph1kDt8j5T6ZuD-lkKkVy9eJnpsolMcJ3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH3TCf4YVYtzSaxOsumj24Gxx