&_nc_ohc=IbtkfD2M8agQ7kNvwE-zQFa&_nc_oc=AdqTxTprcSAFfQgtuoje3a8V7fmtc-KDWwtPeKFivFQqlx8bvfiwYLHvAFOEmkat2Kg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEHJsslwDgJRcbPe3loL-_pj5FzMlbK0tpo5AKoHIEo_g&oe=6A9410C6"}, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": ["Horror", "Zombie", "Survival", "Apocalypse", "Infected"], "long_description": "What begins as a rescue operation soon reveals something far worse: a deadly parasitic infection linked to Dr. Summers' secret experiments.\n\nExplore abandoned houses, underground laboratories, infested streets, and hidden facilities as you fight to survive in a world descending into chaos.\n\n**\u2022 Intense combat against infected creatures and monstrous mutations**\n\n**\u2022 Diverse weapons, including pistols, rifles, axes, and hammers.**\n{1688854632418480}\n**\u2022 Terrifying atmospheric environments**\n\nEach location hides new threats. Every encounter could be your last.\n\nWill you survive?\n\n{998788386377432}", "short_description": "Survive a deadly parasite outbreak in immersive virtual reality. Fight for your life, uncover the truth behind Dr. Summers' experiments, and escape before it's too late."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1473392470779023", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": ["Horror", "Zombie", "Survival", "Infected", "Apocalypse"], "long_description": "Ce qui commence comme une op\u00e9ration de sauvetage r\u00e9v\u00e8le rapidement quelque chose de bien pire : une infection parasitaire mortelle li\u00e9e aux exp\u00e9riences secr\u00e8tes du Dr Summers.\n\nExplorez des maisons abandonn\u00e9es, des laboratoires souterrains, des rues infest\u00e9es et des installations cach\u00e9es tout en essayant de survivre dans un monde plong\u00e9 dans le chaos.\n\n**\u2022 Combat intense contre des cr\u00e9atures infect\u00e9es et des mutations monstrueuses**\n\n**\u2022 Une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d'armes, notamment des pistolets, des fusils, des haches et des marteaux**\n{849856511083043}\n\n**\u2022 Des environnements atmosph\u00e9riques terrifiants**\n\nChaque lieu cache de nouvelles menaces. Chaque rencontre pourrait \u00eatre la derni\u00e8re.\n\nSurvivrez-vous ?\n{810292978682586}", "short_description": "Survivez \u00e0 une \u00e9pid\u00e9mie mortelle de parasites en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle immersive. Luttez pour votre survie, d\u00e9couvrez la v\u00e9rit\u00e9 derri\u00e8re les exp\u00e9riences du Dr Summers et \u00e9chappez-vous avant qu'il ne soit trop tard."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "980870494730078", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Lo que comienza como una operaci\u00f3n de rescate pronto revela algo mucho peor: una infecci\u00f3n parasitaria mortal vinculada a los experimentos secretos del Dr. Summers.\n\nExplora casas abandonadas, laboratorios subterr\u00e1neos, calles infestadas e instalaciones ocultas mientras luchas por sobrevivir en un mundo que se hunde en el caos.\n\n**\u2022 Combate intenso contra criaturas infectadas y mutaciones monstruosas**\n\n**\u2022 Una gran variedad de armas, incluidas pistolas, rifles, hachas y martillos**\n{964600056576192}\n\n**\u2022 Entornos atmosf\u00e9ricos aterradores**\n\nCada ubicaci\u00f3n esconde nuevas amenazas. Cada encuentro podr\u00eda ser el \u00faltimo.\n\n\u00bfSobrevivir\u00e1s?\n{1301940351717343}", "short_description": "Sobrevive a un mortal brote de par\u00e1sitos en realidad virtual inmersiva. Lucha por tu vida, descubre la verdad detr\u00e1s de los experimentos del Dr. Summers y escapa antes de que sea demasiado tarde."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "810148798696239", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City of Hunger: Survive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u6551\u52a9\u4efb\u52d9\u3068\u3057\u3066\u59cb\u307e\u3063\u305f\u51fa\u6765\u4e8b\u306f\u3001\u3084\u304c\u3066\u306f\u308b\u304b\u306b\u6050\u308d\u3057\u3044\u73fe\u5b9f\u3092\u660e\u3089\u304b\u306b\u3059\u308b\u3002\u305d\u308c\u306f\u3001\u30b5\u30de\u30fc\u30ba\u535a\u58eb\u306e\u6975\u79d8\u5b9f\u9a13\u306b\u95a2\u9023\u3059\u308b\u81f4\u547d\u7684\u306a\u5bc4\u751f\u611f\u67d3\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3002\n\n\u653e\u68c4\u3055\u308c\u305f\u5bb6\u5c4b\u3001\u5730\u4e0b\u7814\u7a76\u65bd\u8a2d\u3001\u611f\u67d3\u8005\u304c\u5f98\u5f8a\u3059\u308b\u8857\u8def\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u96a0\u3055\u308c\u305f\u65bd\u8a2d\u3092\u63a2\u7d22\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001\u6df7\u6c8c\u3078\u3068\u5d29\u308c\u3086\u304f\u4e16\u754c\u3067\u751f\u304d\u6b8b\u308c\u3002\n\n**\u2022 \u611f\u67d3\u3057\u305f\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3084\u6050\u308b\u3079\u304d\u5909\u7570\u4f53\u3068\u306e\u6fc0\u3057\u3044\u6226\u95d8**\n\n**\u2022 \u30d4\u30b9\u30c8\u30eb\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5\u30eb\u3001\u65a7\u3001\u30cf\u30f3\u30de\u30fc\u306a\u3069\u591a\u5f69\u306a\u6b66\u5668**\n\n**\u2022 \u6050\u6016\u306b\u6e80\u3061\u305f\u6ca1\u5165\u611f\u306e\u3042\u308b\u74b0\u5883**\n\n\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308b\u5834\u6240\u306b\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u8105\u5a01\u304c\u6f5c\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u3002\u906d\u9047\u3059\u308b\u6575\u3068\u306e\u6226\u3044\u304c\u6700\u5f8c\u306b\u306a\u308b\u304b\u3082\u3057\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002\n\n\u751f\u304d\u5ef6\u3073\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u304b\uff1f\n{1017206384116498}", "short_description": "\u6ca1\u5165\u611f\u3042\u3075\u308c\u308b\u30d0\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30eb\u30ea\u30a2\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u3067\u3001\u81f4\u547d\u7684\u306a\u5bc4\u751f\u866b\u306e\u5927\u6d41\u884c\u3092\u751f\u304d\u5ef6\u3073\u308d\u3002\u547d\u3092\u61f8\u3051\u3066\u6226\u3044\u3001\u30b5\u30de\u30fc\u30ba\u535a\u58eb\u306e\u5b9f\u9a13\u306e\u771f\u5b9f\u3092\u66b4\u304d\u3001\u624b\u9045\u308c\u306b\u306a\u30